{"type":"plan","title":"Đèn Ông Sao Của Tí","logline":"Đêm Trung thu, một chiếc đèn giấy tắt nến tìm lại ánh sáng nhờ che tre giàu của ông nội, bé Tí vui chạy theo đoàn rước đèn dưới trăng tròn.","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Tí stands on the porch railing holding the red star lantern; the candle gutters and dies as a gust lifts the hanging shirts. Night, faint lantern glow on his face.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Nến tắt rồi..."},{"index":2,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Extreme close-up of the star lantern: red cellophane walls glow then darken, the wick curls in a thin smoke ribbon. Night, last candle glow.","mode":"motion","dialogue":null},{"index":3,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"A troop of children parades down the alley, lanterns swaying — carp, rabbit, stars — their laughter rippling. Golden dusk turning to night, lantern light pooling on wet bricks.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Đi đi đèn ông sao, rạng rạng ngõ xóm..."},{"index":4,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Tí alone on the porch, shoulders slumped. Grandfather steps into frame from the shadows, offering the bamboo shade with both hands. Night, porch light warm on wood.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Cháu dùng che này đi."},{"index":5,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Grandfather's weathered hands lower the bamboo cylinder over the star lantern; it seats with a soft click. The candle flares up, painting the weave gold. Night, warm glow.","mode":"motion","dialogue":null},{"index":6,"shotType":"Low angle","description":"Tí sprints down the alley, lantern high, bamboo shade glowing like a tiny lighthouse. The full moon hangs huge above the rooftops. Night, moonlight silver on bricks.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"Trăng tròn quá!"},{"index":7,"shotType":"Slow zoom-in","description":"Grandfather leans on the gate post, smiling, watching Tí merge into the lantern river under the moon. Long paper-cut shadows stretch across the lane. Night, moonlight.","mode":"still","dialogue":"Vui thì mới là Trung thu."}]}
